  - m_Id: 39554833640144896
    m_Localized: Developers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40202542537588736
    m_Localized: "\n\nThe Battle Cats Unite X (UX)\n<color=#A0A0FF>\nThis game is
      a fan-made version of \"The Battle Cats\"\ncreated with Unity\nIt aims to add
      a certain personal worldview and plot on the basis of the original version,\nand
      to innovate characters and skills.\n\nEverything is under construction.\nIf
      you are very interested in the development of this game,\nplease feel free
      to contact me! \n</color>\nAuthor: Kizumiii\n\nBilibili: https://space.bilibili.com/628684627\n\nX:
      https://x.com/TK_Kizumiii \n\nQQ Group: 751417960\n\n---------------------------------------------\n\nAlso,
      thanks to all my assistors who participated in the production and gave great
      help to the game: \n\n<color=#A0A0FF>$ Technical Support on Unity $</color>\n<color=#60FF60>#
      timmy77\uFF08@\u61D2\u764C\u672B\u671F-\u5B9D\u5B9D\uFF09</color> \n\n<color=#A0A0FF>$
      Game Art and Animation $</color>\n<color=#60FF60># SADE\uFF08@SADE\u6EE1\u5730\u6253\u6EDA\uFF09</color>\n<color=#60FF60>#
      Arealsky\uFF08@\u306B\u3083\u3093\u3053\u4F20\u6559\u58EB\uFF09 </color>\n\n<color=#A0A0FF>$
      Numerical Game Designer $\n<color=#60FF60># \u609F\u5988\uFF08@\u5C0F\u609F\u5988\u5C0F\u6D0B\uFF09</color>\n<color=#60FF60>#
      \u5E0C\u5C14\u8299\u9171\uFF08@\u5E0C\u5C14\u8299\u9171\uFF09</color>\n<color=#60FF60>#
      \u767D\u6BD4\u514B\u63D0\u5C3C\uFF08@\u767D\u6BD4\u514B\u63D0\u5C3C\uFF09</color>\n\n<color=#A0A0FF>$
      Text and Localization $</color>\n<color=#60FF60># \u795E\u732B\u4E8C\u4E16\uFF08@\u795E\u732BMSN\uFF09</color>\n\n---------------------------------------------\n\nAnd
      thank you for supporting this game.\nYou give me a stronger motivation to continue
      on it!\n\nFan works do not involve any profit\nIf you paid for this game,\n\n<size=64><color=#FF6060>YOU
      WERE CHEATED</color></size>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
