      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101229180230123520
    m_Localized: "Welcome to UX! \nWe've noticed that this is your first time logging
      into the game. \nThis will help you set up your account.\nDon't worry! Your
      local save remains at anytime."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101229628001435648
    m_Localized: Create Account!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101230045921886208
    m_Localized: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101252670299652096
    m_Localized: Retake ID
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101253789935550464
    m_Localized: 'Please input your player nickname:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112416155494596608
    m_Localized: 'Please input your transfer keycode:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112440714209869824
    m_Localized: Upload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112475500144050176
    m_Localized: '<size=48><color=red>Transfer Safety Warning</color></size>


      You
      are going to upload your account data to the UX server. Your account will be
      firmly saved at the server, but your <color=red>local data will be deleted</color>
      once it is completed! Please make sure you well remember your <color=red>Player
      ID</color> (not user name) and your <color=red>transfer code</color>, or you
      will be hard to find your data back!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112478662389219328
    m_Localized: Exit Game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112480020454522880
    m_Localized: "<size=48><color=red>Data Upload Success!</color></size>\n\nYour
      account was firmly saved at UX server!\nPlease use your <color=red>Player ID</color>\uFF08not
      user name\uFF09and <color=red>Transfer Code</color> to restore your account
      data.\nIt's Kiz's pleasure for your support to UX!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112682131305873408
    m_Localized: 'Your user name: '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112745939604946944
    m_Localized: Quit Game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112746027681136640
    m_Localized: Let's Go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112746939497660416
    m_Localized: '<size=64>Welcome back!</size>


      Your account has successfully
      retrieve from the UX server!

      Thank you for your support for UX.

      Please
      continue and enjoy the game!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112761105964941312
    m_Localized: Please think twice and click your dicision again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112761073295507456
    m_Localized: '<size=64><color=red>Delete Account</color></size>


      Doing
      this will permanently delete your account from <color=red>both local and server</color>,
      meaning that you will lose your account FOREVER! Are you sure to do so?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 112763154324602880
    m_Localized: '<size=64>Account Delete Success</size>


      Your account has
      been successfully deleted.

      Thanks again for all your support to TBC
      UX!

      Please restart the game and begin your new journey.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
